You can obtain DLC through the DOWNLOAD menu.

After downloading, these pacts can be found and played by navigating to: Read Journal → Mad Chronicle → Pacts → Additional Pacts

Newly downloaded Raiments can be found and equipped in:
Portraiture→Appearance→Raiments→Raiments: Top
Portraiture→Appearance→Raiments→Raiments: Bottom

Newly downloaded raiments can be located in the list of raiments found in Bazaar Ledger → Carnatux the Merchant → Buy Raiments. Meet the required conditions to obtain them.

"Otherworld Pacts" have been added in among the additional pacts.
To play them, navigate to: Read Journal → Mad Chronicle → Pacts → Additional Pacts → Otherworld Pacts


